        <mxCell id="p0-25" value="&lt;b&gt;MySMS backend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;22 domain modules, one schema each&lt;br&gt;(master, platform, iam, org, people, academics, sis, hr, payroll, admission, attendance, facility, timetable, assessment, lms, finance, library, transport, comms, frontoffice, careers, privacy)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;REST (OpenAPI) + gRPC; iam is the OAuth 2.0 issuer&lt;br&gt;runs as one monolith or as one service per module" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="250" width="440" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
