        <mxCell id="p0-55" value="&lt;b&gt;Product boundaries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- A tenant is a school group; every row is scoped to one tenant.&lt;br&gt;- Staff, students and guardians sign in with tenant accounts; platform operators with platform-staff tokens (MFA).&lt;br&gt;- A provider that is not configured answers 503 for the operations that need it; everything else works." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="720" width="440" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
